  "question": {
    "text": "<div>\r<p><span style=\"\rcolor:black\">A rectangular glass slab <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ABCD</mi></math></span><span>, of refractive index, &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>n</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>,</mo> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;is immersed in water of refractive index &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>n</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub> <mi>n</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>&gt;</mo><msub> <mi>n</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;A ray of light is incident at the surface <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math>&nbsp;of the slab, as shown. The maximum value of the angle of incidence &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>α</mi> <mrow> <mi>max</mi> </mrow> </msub> <mo>,</mo> </mrow> </math> such that the ray comes out only from the other surface <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CD</mi></math>,&nbsp;is given by</span></p>\r\r<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0077_30d47720f9ab.jpeg\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 122px;\" /><br />\r&nbsp;</p>\r</div>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></math> </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></math> </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></math> </span></p></div>",
